 ns. For example\, a family of elastin proteins form stretchable fibers\, w
 hich allow the constant movement of human skin\, blood vessels\, and lungs
 . We aim to decode the secrets of biological materials by investigating se
 quence patterns in repetitive proteins\, towards establishing systematic p
